# Read spec.md first

Before making changes to any Django app, read its `spec.md` to understand the domain model, business rules, and runtime requirements.

## Where to find spec.md

- Project root: `spec.md` — top-level project specification
- Inside each Django app directory: `<app>/spec.md` — app-level specification
